        "post_text_html": "Si hay algo que tengo claro, es que me encanta compartir experiencias a trav&#xE9;s de mi trayectoria. Internar siempre proporcionar nuevos conocimientos as&#xED; como ofrecer los consejos que me hubieran gustado recibir antes de comenzar mi vida laboral.  <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmentoring&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Mentoring</a> <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcoachinglaboral&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>#coachinglaboral</a> <br/><br/>Los d&#xED;as 12 y 13 de Noviembre he tenido la oportunidad de colaborar por 6&#xB0; a&#xF1;o consecutivo con la <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://es.linkedin.com/company/escuela-de-ingenierias-industriales-uma?trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>Escuela de Ingenier&#xED;as Industriales (Universidad de M&#xE1;laga)</a> mi seminario de <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fleanmanufacturing&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LeanManufacturing</a> para la asignatura de Ingenier&#xED;a de Fabricaci&#xF3;n en la industria, para los alumnos del m&#xE1;ster de Ingenier&#xED;a Industrial.<br/><br/>Agradecer al Doctor <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://es.linkedin.com/in/lorenzo-sevilla-hurtado-343a922a0?trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lorenzo Sevilla Hurtado</a> por confiar en m&#xED; un a&#xF1;o m&#xE1;s, as&#xED; como a todos los estudiantes que asistieron y me han estado contactando para poder crecer juntos fomentando el Network Malague&#xF1;o.<br/><br/>Siendo sincero, nunca hab&#xED;a recibido un aplauso como el que recib&#xED; en la &#xFA;ltima clase tras la &#xFA;ltima din&#xE1;mica de grupo, creo que a&#xFA;n tengo la sonrisa marcada en la cara.<br/><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2FmAerlaga&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>#M&#xE1;laga</a> <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flean&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Lean</a> <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fleanmanufacturing&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LeanManufacturing</a> <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmentoring&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Mentoring</a> <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmentor&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate>#mentor</a> <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fetsii&amp;trk=public_post-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_post-text